"Purifying Flames (Dublinn Evocator) - Arknights Terra Wiki (https://arknights.wiki.gg/wiki/Purifying_Flames_%28Dublinn_Evocator%29)\nciteturn830search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last week; enemy_1177_dufrbl\n\n# Purifying Flames (Dublinn Evocator)\n\nJump to navigation Jump to search\n\nPurifying Flames\n\nIntroduced in\n\nEpisode 09\n\nUpgraded version\n\nPurifying Flames (Dublinn Evocator Leader)\n\nInternal name\n\nenemy_1177_dufrbl\n\nIn Other Languages\n\nChinese\n\n净浊之焰\n\nJapanese\n\n浄化の炎\n\nGeneral Information\n\nType\n\nNormal\n\nAttack pattern\n\nMelee\n\nLocation\n\nGround\n\nAssociated Enemies\n\nThe Purifying Flames is a hidden normal enemy in Arknights.\n\n## Overview[edit]\n\nA fireball created by Dublinn Evocators and controlled by them to move towards the enemy before exploding on impact, causing fiery destruction in an area.\n\nAbility  | Cooldown\n--- | ---\n\n  * Has no hitbox.\n  * Despawns after 10 seconds or when reaching the end of the route taken by the Dublinn Evocator that spawns the Purifying Flames.\n | Innate\nATK linearly reduces over time, up to -70% after 10 seconds.  | Passive\nExplodes (The Purifying Flames despawn afterward) when blocked or a friendly unit is in a 1×1 area centered on the Purifying Flames, dealing 100% ATK Arts damage and inflicting 100% ATK Burn to friendly units over a radius of 1.8.  | –\n\nDue to not being an insignificant enemy, Purifying Flames will keep the operation from ending after all enemies have been defeated so long as at least one of them is active.\n\n## Stats[edit]\n\nHP  | ATK  | DEF  | RES\n--- | --- | --- | ---\n100  | 500  | 0  | 0\nMovement Speed  | Attack Interval  | Elemental RES  | Effect Resistance\n--- | --- | --- | ---\n2.5  | 2  | 0  | 0\nAttack range  | HP regeneration  | Weight  | Aggression level\n--- | --- | --- | ---\n1  | –  | 0  | 0\nLife Point penalty  | Effect susceptibilities\n--- | ---\n0  | Silence • Stun • Sleep • Freeze • Levitate • Frighten • Fear • Paralysis • Lure---